vive their relentless pursuit and uncover their dark origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE ENDINGS</strong> – Your choices shape the fate of Sloane and her friends. Can you unearth the full truth behind Little Creek’s horrors, or will the town’s mysteries consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
